{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>You shall not glean.</b> You shall not take the עוֹלֵלוֹת in it — these are the single berries. What are עוֹלֵלוֹת? Any cluster that has neither shoulder nor drip-cluster (Sifra)." "<b>And the gleanings of your vineyard.</b> Grape-berries that fall during the harvest." "<b>I am YHWH your Elohim.</b> I am trustworthy to pay; and I exact payment from you only in lives, as it says: ״אַל תִּגְזָל דָּל״ etc. ״כִּי ה' יָרִיב רִיבָם״ etc. (Proverbs 22)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:05.554132950Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}